# CITATION.cff: how to cite this software (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# A template of the private repository (release/public/CITATION.cff); the
# `doi` and `date-released` of the archived release are filled at release
# time (the frozen-run procedure's Stage 6.3); the license was decided
# 2026-10-28 (MIT; the private repository's walkthrough entry O-23).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PROTEUS drag-and-drop pipeline (proteus-dnd)"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline that reads platform event exports of a Runestone textbook,
  rebuilds each student's drag-and-drop board after every logged move,
  validates the rebuilt boards against the boards logged at each check,
  scores the attempts and exports the datasets reported in
  "Reconstructing and Validating Drag-and-Drop Response Trajectories".
authors:
  - family-names: Cox
    given-names: Geoffrey
    affiliation: Virginia Military Institute
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/geoff-cox/proteus-dnd
license: MIT
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX   # the archived release, at tag time
# date-released: YYYY-MM-DD     # at tag time
